<title>USA: Seacoast Banking Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>Seacoast Banking Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>STUART, Fla. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seacoast Banking Corp of Florida and Subsidiaries</p>
<p>				Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p> (Dollars in thousands,     September 30,  September 30,</p>
<p>  except per share data)  1996     1995	1996	 1995</p>
<p>Summary of Earnings</p>
<p> Net Income		$ 1,586  $ 1,756    $ 5,655    $ 4,933</p>
<p>Operating Net Income (D)</p>
<p>				 1,902    1,758	5,971	4,933</p>
