<p>Note:</p>
<p>(A) Calculated on a fully taxable equivalent basis using amortized cost.</p>
<p>(B) These ratios are stated on an annualized basis.</p>
<p>(C) The calculation of ROA and ROE do not include the mark-to-market unrealized gains (losses) because the unrealized gains (losses) are not included in net income.</p>
<p>(D) Before special SAIF assessment of $500,000 ($316,000 after tax).</p>
<p>N/M -- Not meaningful.</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Seacoast Banking Corp of Florida.</p>
